<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Michael Schulte, Andreas Herbig, Patrick Pyke Salmy, Ricardo Muñoz &amp; Caswell</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">这半生我都在竭力追逐梦想</text><text for="L2">可途中那些细碎的时光</text><text for="L3">才是我心之所向</text><text for="L4">如明月引动潮汐起落</text><text for="L5">心底总有一首歌在回响</text><text for="L6">自降生起 便流淌在我的血脉之中</text><text for="L7">我一路奔跑 只为探寻</text><text for="L8">这浮生奔波究竟有何真意</text><text for="L9">虽懵懂迷茫 却有倾诉不尽的心声</text><text for="L10">他日回首 定当了无遗憾</text><text for="L11">道尽所有未曾言说的肺腑之言</text><text for="L12">朝夕之间 尽情奔赴心之所爱</text><text for="L13">若不敢叩问 终将一无所获</text><text for="L14">坚信此时此刻就是最好的安排</text><text for="L15">义无反顾地活在当下 别无他选</text><text for="L16">这一生我都在执着追寻梦想</text><text for="L17">可沿途那些微小而真切的瞬间</text><text for="L18">才是我生命的归宿</text><text for="L19">这一生总是瞄准那条终点线</text><text for="L20">从未真正放慢匆匆的脚步</text><text for="L21">可原来这些片刻 才是我唯一的渴求</text><text for="L22">足矣此生 别无所求</text><text for="L23">这便是我永恒的期盼</text><text for="L24">哪怕漫漫长路依然在追梦</text><text for="L25">但旅途中的每一次停顿</text><text for="L26">都已足够丰盈我心</text><text for="L27">我们总在遥望未至的明天</text><text for="L28">试图理清生活所有的兵荒马乱</text><text for="L29">却忘了眼下经历的一切 才是最珍贵的回忆</text><text for="L30">或许我真正想说的是</text><text for="L31">你愿否同我在此刻稍作停留</text><text for="L32">错过了太多 这一次我绝不再任由它溜走</text><text for="L33">往后回首 定当毫无悔意</text><text for="L34">讲出所有该说的心里话</text><text for="L35">每一天都为真正珍视的事物而活</text><text for="L36">若不主动争取 便只能擦肩而过</text><text for="L37">确信唯有当下才是唯一解答</text><text for="L38">全力以赴地去生活 绝不留退路</text><text for="L39">多少岁月都在向前飞奔追梦</text><text for="L40">却发现途经的吉光片羽</text><text for="L41">才是心中最深切的依归</text><text for="L42">曾经一味执念于终点的辉煌</text><text for="L43">甚至不曾为身旁风景驻足</text><text for="L44">可那些被忽略的片刻 才是我的全部所需</text><text for="L45">如此便已足够 无须更多</text><text for="L46">这就是我终其一生的守望</text><text for="L47">尽管一生都在不停追寻远方</text><text for="L48">而沿途经历的点点滴滴</text><text for="L49">已是灵魂所有的寄托</text><text for="L50">耶</text><text for="L51">无论未来将迎来怎样的风雨</text><text for="L52">伫立在命运的十字路口</text><text for="L53">我深知良机已至</text><text for="L54">定要紧握属于自己的每分每秒</text><text for="L55">因我已期盼了太久</text><text for="L56">这漫漫一生虽总在追逐梦想</text><text for="L57">但一路走来的朝夕相伴</text><text for="L58">方是我此生最美的风景</text><text for="L59">虽曾一门心思冲向那条终点线</text><text for="L60">忘了静心体味当下的温度</text><text for="L61">原来这寻常点滴 才是我唯一的渴求</text><text for="L62">唯愿拥抱当下 别无他求</text><text for="L63">此生所愿 唯此而已</text><text for="L64">回望岁月 哪怕仍在向着梦想奔赴</text><text for="L65">但穿插在过往里的每一个片段</text><text for="L66">都已是我无怨无悔的归宿</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="All I Need"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Michael Schulte"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Highs &amp; Lows"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="DEPT21900011"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1472495589"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1538743560"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1547577419"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:00.273" end="3:08.330"><p begin="0:00.273" end="0:03.533" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:00.273" end="0:00.703">All</span> <span begin="0:00.703" end="0:01.223">my</span> <span begin="0:01.223" end="0:01.793">life</span> <span begin="0:01.793" end="0:01.993">I've</span> <span begin="0:01.993" end="0:02.183">been</span> <span begin="0:02.183" end="0:02.503">chas</span><span begin="0:02.503" end="0:02.753">ing</span> <span begin="0:02.753" end="0:03.043">down</span> <span begin="0:03.043" end="0:03.103">a</span> <span begin="0:03.103" end="0:03.533">dream</span></p><p begin="0:03.533" end="0:05.543" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:03.533" end="0:03.803">But</span> <span begin="0:03.803" end="0:03.993">all</span> <span begin="0:03.993" end="0:04.093">the</span> <span begin="0:04.093" end="0:04.473">mo</span><span begin="0:04.473" end="0:04.813">ments</span> <span begin="0:04.813" end="0:05.013">in</span> <span begin="0:05.013" end="0:05.183">be</span><span begin="0:05.183" end="0:05.543">tween</span></p><p begin="0:05.548" end="0:07.818" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:05.548" end="0:05.758">Yeah,</span> <span begin="0:05.758" end="0:06.078">that</span> <span begin="0:06.078" end="0:06.328">is</span> <span begin="0:06.328" end="0:06.848">all</span> <span begin="0:06.848" end="0:07.238">I</span> <span begin="0:07.238" end="0:07.818">need</span></p><p begin="0:07.828" end="0:09.628" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:07.828" end="0:08.058">Like</span> <span begin="0:08.058" end="0:08.158">the</span> <span begin="0:08.158" end="0:08.598">moon</span> <span begin="0:08.598" end="0:08.758">it</span> <span begin="0:08.758" end="0:09.078">pulls</span> <span begin="0:09.078" end="0:09.168">the</span> <span begin="0:09.168" end="0:09.628">tide</span></p><p begin="0:09.626" end="0:11.536" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:09.626" end="0:09.836">I've</span> <span begin="0:09.836" end="0:09.986">al</span><span begin="0:09.986" end="0:10.206">ways</span> <span begin="0:10.206" end="0:10.596">had</span> <span begin="0:10.596" end="0:10.766">this</span> <span begin="0:10.766" end="0:10.976">song</span> <span begin="0:10.976" end="0:11.096">in</span><span begin="0:11.096" end="0:11.536">side</span></p><p begin="0:11.536" end="0:15.266" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:11.536" end="0:11.866">Since</span> <span begin="0:11.866" end="0:12.086">I</span> <span begin="0:12.086" end="0:12.326">was</span> <span begin="0:12.326" end="0:12.646">born</span> <span begin="0:12.646" end="0:12.926">yeah</span> <span begin="0:12.926" end="0:13.036">I</span> <span begin="0:13.036" end="0:13.276">can</span> <span begin="0:13.276" end="0:13.666">feel</span> <span begin="0:13.666" end="0:13.906">it</span> <span begin="0:13.906" end="0:14.066">in</span> <span begin="0:14.066" end="0:14.336">my</span> <span begin="0:14.336" end="0:15.266">veins</span></p><p begin="0:15.893" end="0:17.623" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:15.893" end="0:16.113">I've</span> <span begin="0:16.113" end="0:16.863">runnin'</span> <span begin="0:16.863" end="0:17.133">just</span> <span begin="0:17.133" end="0:17.213">to</span> <span begin="0:17.213" end="0:17.623">see</span></p><p begin="0:17.625" end="0:19.695" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.625" end="0:17.865">What</span> <span begin="0:17.865" end="0:18.085">this</span> <span begin="0:18.085" end="0:18.315">is</span> <span begin="0:18.315" end="0:18.605">all</span> <span begin="0:18.605" end="0:18.795">sup</span><span begin="0:18.795" end="0:19.155">posed</span> <span begin="0:19.155" end="0:19.255">to</span> <span begin="0:19.255" end="0:19.695">mean</span></p><p begin="0:19.692" end="0:23.212" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:19.692" end="0:19.872">I</span> <span begin="0:19.872" end="0:20.402">didn't</span> <span begin="0:20.402" end="0:20.652">know</span> <span begin="0:20.652" end="0:20.932">but</span> <span begin="0:20.932" end="0:21.182">I</span> <span begin="0:21.182" end="0:21.362">had</span> <span begin="0:21.362" end="0:21.662">so</span> <span begin="0:21.662" end="0:21.932">much</span> <span begin="0:21.932" end="0:22.172">left</span> <span begin="0:22.172" end="0:22.292">to</span> <span begin="0:22.292" end="0:23.212">say</span></p><p begin="0:23.945" end="0:25.835" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:23.945" end="0:24.055">I</span> <span begin="0:24.055" end="0:24.175">will</span> <span begin="0:24.175" end="0:24.325">look</span> <span begin="0:24.325" end="0:24.685">back</span> <span begin="0:24.685" end="0:24.855">with</span> <span begin="0:24.855" end="0:25.215">no</span> <span begin="0:25.215" end="0:25.405">re</span><span begin="0:25.405" end="0:25.835">gret</span></p><p begin="0:25.833" end="0:27.713" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:25.833" end="0:26.033">Say</span> <span begin="0:26.033" end="0:26.183">all</span> <span begin="0:26.183" end="0:26.273">the</span> <span begin="0:26.273" end="0:26.753">things</span> <span begin="0:26.753" end="0:26.863">I</span> <span begin="0:26.863" end="0:27.393">should've</span> <span begin="0:27.393" end="0:27.713">said</span></p><p begin="0:27.955" end="0:31.965" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:27.955" end="0:28.175">Do</span> <span begin="0:28.175" end="0:28.425">what</span><span begin="0:28.425" end="0:28.765">ev</span><span begin="0:28.765" end="0:28.865">er</span> <span begin="0:28.865" end="0:29.445">matters</span> <span begin="0:29.445" end="0:29.745">to</span> <span begin="0:29.745" end="0:30.035">me</span> <span begin="0:30.035" end="0:30.205">ev</span><span begin="0:30.205" end="0:30.425">ery</span> <span begin="0:30.425" end="0:31.965">day</span></p><p begin="0:32.035" end="0:33.996" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:32.035" end="0:32.156">'Cause</span> <span begin="0:32.156" end="0:32.236">if</span> <span begin="0:32.236" end="0:32.346">you</span> <span begin="0:32.346" end="0:32.776">don't</span> <span begin="0:32.776" end="0:33.036">ask</span> <span begin="0:33.036" end="0:33.216">you</span> <span begin="0:33.216" end="0:33.526">don't</span> <span begin="0:33.526" end="0:33.996">get</span></p><p begin="0:33.997" end="0:35.757" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:33.997" end="0:34.217">Gotta</span> <span begin="0:34.217" end="0:34.327">be</span><span begin="0:34.327" end="0:34.777">lieve</span> <span begin="0:34.777" end="0:35.027">that</span> <span begin="0:35.027" end="0:35.337">this</span> <span begin="0:35.337" end="0:35.597">is</span> <span begin="0:35.597" end="0:35.757">it</span></p><p begin="0:36.030" end="0:39.230" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:36.030" end="0:36.150">We're</span> <span begin="0:36.150" end="0:36.390">gonna</span> <span begin="0:36.390" end="0:36.820">live</span> <span begin="0:36.820" end="0:37.030">it</span> <span begin="0:37.030" end="0:37.290">like</span> <span begin="0:37.290" end="0:37.610">there</span> <span begin="0:37.610" end="0:37.830">is</span> <span begin="0:37.830" end="0:38.100">no</span> <span begin="0:38.100" end="0:38.350">oth</span><span begin="0:38.350" end="0:38.480">er</span> <span begin="0:38.480" end="0:39.230">way</span></p><p begin="0:40.594" end="0:43.874" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:40.594" end="0:41.044">All</span> <span begin="0:41.044" end="0:41.544">my</span> <span begin="0:41.544" end="0:42.114">life</span> <span begin="0:42.114" end="0:42.314">I've</span> <span begin="0:42.314" end="0:42.524">been</span> <span begin="0:42.524" end="0:43.094">chasin'</span> <span begin="0:43.094" end="0:43.404">down</span> <span begin="0:43.404" end="0:43.474">a</span> <span begin="0:43.474" end="0:43.874">dream</span></p><p begin="0:43.876" end="0:45.886" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:43.876" end="0:44.116">But</span> <span begin="0:44.116" end="0:44.326">all</span> <span begin="0:44.326" end="0:44.416">the</span> <span begin="0:44.416" end="0:44.846">mo</span><span begin="0:44.846" end="0:45.146">ments</span> <span begin="0:45.146" end="0:45.356">in</span> <span begin="0:45.356" end="0:45.536">be</span><span begin="0:45.536" end="0:45.886">tween</span></p><p begin="0:45.883" end="0:48.363" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:45.883" end="0:46.093">Yeah,</span> <span begin="0:46.093" end="0:46.393">that</span> <span begin="0:46.393" end="0:46.653">is</span> <span begin="0:46.653" end="0:47.173">all</span> <span begin="0:47.173" end="0:47.593">I</span> <span begin="0:47.593" end="0:48.363">ne